cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "For this private review draft, cite GPT 6.2 Astra (Codex) with Serafim Batzoglou and identify the exact Git commit."
title: "Unbounded minimum Scott ranks for Boolean algebras"
type: software
# Software license. See LICENSE.md for the manuscript and proof guide.
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "GPT 6.2 Astra (Codex)"
  - given-names: "Serafim"
    family-names: "Batzoglou"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SerafimBatzoglou/boolean-scott-spectral-gaps"
keywords:
  - Boolean algebras
  - Scott rank
  - infinitary logic
  - Lean
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization showing that for every countable ordinal b, some
  satisfiable pure Boolean sentence of complexity Pi_(omega+4) has no
  countable model of Scott rank at most b.
